{
  "question": "Can I keep my rear seats in and still sleep on the BikerBed?"
}

{
  "answerable": true,
  "answer": "Unfortunately not. With the rear seats in, the BikerBed has enough headroom for you to sit up comfortably or use it as a sofa, but to sleep on it or fully extend it you'll need to take the rear seats out. If you want to switch back later, after the initial setup the BikerBed can be removed or reinstalled in under 30 minutes. You can do it on your own, though an extra pair of hands helps.",
